{
  "_comment": [
    "THE CRAB'S DEPART TABLE, TRANSCRIBED (cultureway phase E3, census C6).",
    "Each engine rule's weight lambda re-expressed as a Layer-1 straight-line",
    "program, and each branching line as a select program over templates.",
    "THE SCALE: every weight program computes 300 * purse * w - one scaled",
    "space so the argmax and every tie land exactly where the float table's",
    "do (purse clears the left/purse rules' division, 300 clears every",
    "constant denominator: 4, 12, 2, and 150 = 30*GMIN). The quarters",
    "override multiplies UN-divided in visQuote, a constant x4 when nobody",
    "declared one. qn(0.85) = 891290 is the Q20 need threshold, compiled to",
    "its exact integer the way every authored fraction crosses the boundary.",
    "The engine lambdas remain the fallback; the per-rule sweep and the",
    "whole-town log run are the proof.",
    "WHAT THE PROOF IS, EXACTLY - and it is NOT byte-equality, which this",
    "note used to claim. The scaled space means a program's weight VALUE is",
    "deliberately not the lambda's float; only the ordering is shared. So the",
    "sweep compares what is comparable: which rule wins, its mood, and its",
    "sentence, over ~4100 staged and combinatorial rows. The guarantee is",
    "BEHAVIOURAL EQUIVALENCE, and comparing the two weights numerically would",
    "be a category error, not a stronger test.",
    "THE COST, MEASURED (2026-08-24): a weight typo too small to flip an",
    "argmax on any of those rows is INVISIBLE. PUSHI 36000 -> 36001 in the",
    "rough weight shipped through the whole focus battery 12/12 GREEN on both",
    "engines. The same weight cut 100x (36000 -> 360, a dropped-zeros typo)",
    "reds the sweep at row 456, naming both verdicts. Small drifts in a",
    "weight constant are the one class of transcription error this file's",
    "gates do not catch; a wrong OP, a wrong slot, a wrong template or a",
    "missing rule all still fail loudly."
  ],
